# Strata (upstream) reads and writes the udiskie configuration with
# serde_norway, which uses unsafe-libyaml-norway: a Rust translation of
# libyaml (c2rust), compiled from source like every crate of the binary.
# Lintian sees the libyaml version strings; there is no C library to link
# instead. Replacing the crate is an upstream change (Files follow-up).
embedded-library libyaml [usr/bin/querencia-files]
# German word in the German README.Debian, not an English misspelling.
spelling-error-in-readme-debian Programm Program [usr/share/doc/querencia-files/README.Debian]
# Both desktop files of Files are hidden bridges to Querencia Dateien (the
# replacement of Files, package querencia-dateien, a dependency of this
# package): their Exec is querencia-dateien on purpose.
desktop-command-not-in-package querencia-dateien [usr/share/applications/org.querencia.Files.desktop]
desktop-command-not-in-package querencia-dateien [usr/share/applications/io.github.lgse.Strata.desktop]
